# Generated, measured or asserted byte-for-byte. Formatting any of these changes what a gate
# compares against, so the gate fails on a change that altered no behaviour at all.
packages/*/dist
**/generated/
**/__snapshots__/
packages/core/CHANGELOG.json
# Written by `npm run capabilities`, and a gate compares it to the registry byte for byte.
packages/script/capabilities.json
package-lock.json
.vitest
